Package: seedcheck
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-yaml
Recommends: snapd
Description: test cloud-init configurations across Ubuntu releases
 Seedcheck launches a cloud-init user-data file in LXD containers on
 several Ubuntu releases, checks the result inside each one, and reports
 a pass/fail matrix per release.
 .
 It needs LXD, which Ubuntu ships as a snap: sudo snap install lxd.
